// Units drawn with an animated 3D model instead of boxes: unit id -> model
// manifest. Paths are relative to assets/. A manifest is written by the art
// build (see docs/art/peasant.md); a unit whose manifest or model is missing
// or fails to load keeps its boxes. Every *.ron in this folder is merged
// (static.ron, generated by the static art build, lists buildings and
// nodes; see docs/art/static-models.md). Read by af_render at startup.
(
    units: {
        "peasant": "models/peasant/peasant.model.ron",
    },
)
